Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Previously on Grey's Anatomy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前情提要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The seven years you spend here as a surgical resident
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在此担任外科住院医师的七年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:09.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}will be the best and worst of your life. You'll be pushed to the breaking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:09.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会是毕生最美好和最痛苦的时光 你们将被逼到崩溃的临界点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:11.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eight will switch to an easier specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:11.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们之中有八人 将被调往较轻松的科室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five of you will crack under pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五人将在压力下崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two of you will be asked to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:15.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两人将被请辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:17.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd, we should pretend it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:17.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生 我们该假装事情没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What never happened? You sleeping with me last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事情没发生过？ 是你昨晚跟我上床
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or you throwing me out this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是你今天早上赶我出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're an attending, and I'm your intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是主治医师 我是你的实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:26.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Stop looking at me like that. - Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 别再那样子看我 - 什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like you've seen me naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像我裸体似的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your first shift starts now and lasts 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:31.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们从现在开始值班 时间48小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:33.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're interns, grunts, nobodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:35.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是实习医生、无名小卒 处于外科食物链最底层
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:35.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}bottom of the surgical food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:37.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:37.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and I are gonna have so much fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟我会相处得非常愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know Meredith is inbred?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们可知梅若迪丝出身医家？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:45.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like it's uncommon here to be a doctor's parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:45.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里的人有医生父母很正常…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:47.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Royally inbred. Her mother is Ellis Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:47.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说的是名医 她母亲是伊莉丝葛蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:48.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up. The Ellis Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:48.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧 那个伊莉丝葛蕾？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's a living legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是传奇人物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's me, Mom. Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 是我 梅若迪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna survive this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会撑过去的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's all about lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:15.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（征求室友）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:16.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切皆与“线”有关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The finish line at the end of residency.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}住院医生实习期结束的终点线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:25.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Waiting in line for a chance at the operating table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:25.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}排队成线 等待做手术的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then there's the most important line,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后是最重要的一条线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the line separating you from the people you work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将你与同事隔开的界线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.67,0:01:41.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't help to get too familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.67,0:01:41.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}变得太熟没有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:47.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:47.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}何必成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need boundaries between you and the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你需要在自己和其他人之间画下界线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Other people are far too messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其他人太混乱麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:01.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's all about lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:01.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切皆与“线”有关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drawing lines in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}画下清楚的界线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and praying like hell no one crosses them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并拼命祈祷不会有人越线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm sure you're very nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我确信你人很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I'm very particular about who lives in my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我对室友非常挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're just not right. - Why? Look, I'm quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你就是不适合 - 为什么？听着 我很安静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No loud music, no parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会大声听音乐、不会开派对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where were you when the Challenger exploded?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在挑战者号爆炸时多大？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:21.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:21.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The space shuttle. Challenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那艘航天飞机 挑战者号
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I was in kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好像在读幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就对了 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why put up posters if you don't want roommates?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不想要室友 为何还贴海报征人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:34.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do want roommates. We're together 100 hours a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:34.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想要室友 但我们一周都相处一百个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:35.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want to live together, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:35.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还想一起住？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:37.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see you bring bribes now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:37.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在还带贿赂品啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mom irons my scrubs. I have to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈会熨烫我的手术服 我必须搬离那里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:43.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not a bribe. I don't think it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:43.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是贿赂品 我觉得这不是好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I can put down last... - It's totally a bribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我能先付头几期房租… - 那就是贿赂品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can cook and I'm an obsessive cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会煮饭 而且很爱干净
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:50.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I just want two total strangers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:50.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 我只想要找两个陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}who I don't have to talk to or be nice to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不必交谈或和颜以对的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:55.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it's not a bribe. It's a mocha latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:55.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是贿赂品 这是摩卡拿铁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:58.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, you run the code team. Meredith, take the trauma pager.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:58.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 你负责急救组 梅若迪丝 负责创伤呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina, deliver the weekend labs to the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜 分送周末检验报告给病患
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:02.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie, you're on sutures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:02.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 你负责缝合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Bailey, I was hoping to assist you in the OR today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利医生 我希望今天能进手术室协助你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe do a minor procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许能做个小手术
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I'm ready. Mocha latte?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得我准备好了 要喝摩卡拿铁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she gets to cut, I want to cut too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若她能动刀 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Me, too. - I wouldn't mind another shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:16.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不介意再尝试 若大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:17.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every intern wants to perform their first surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每位实习医生都想要做首次手术
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那不是你们的工作 知道你们的工作是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.83,0:03:23.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know what your job is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To make your resident happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你们的住院医生开心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I look happy? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看上去开心吗？不开心 为什么？因为我的实习生爱抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Because my interns are whiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what will make me look happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道什么会让我开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Having a code team staffed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}召集急救小组人员、响应创伤呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}having the trauma pages answered,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}having the weekend labs delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}分送周末检验报告
