Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:40.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而她穿着一样的鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it's just... stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这实在…太蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I'm tired, and forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是累了 当我没说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道得怎么办吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:53.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:53.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's sick and twisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那病态又扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We said last time was the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们上次已经说好不再去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've been doing it without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你曾背着我自己去？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:04.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nancy Reagan lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:04.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}南希里根也曾说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't just say no. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你拒绝不了的 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know what would happen if anyone knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道被发现会有何后果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是要去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can come with me, or you can stay here and be miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以一起来 或在这里痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are such a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真像个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:35.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a code.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:35.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急救呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:51.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There were no tests ordered, and the baby has a murmur.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看没有安排检验 但这宝宝心脏有杂音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He turned blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他刚发绀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a surgeon. You're not authorized to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是外科医生 无权进来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know how much trouble you can get into for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道会因此惹上多大的麻烦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:40.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you going to do any tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:40.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算做任何检验吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a benign systolic ejection murmur. It goes away with age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是良性的心脏收缩射血杂音 会随年龄增长消失
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So you're not gonna do tests? - He's not your patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 所以你不做检验？ - 他不是你的病人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:49.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He's not even on your service. - Are you sure it's benign?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他甚至不属于你的科室 - 你确定是良性的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:52.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a doctor, too, you know. You should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:52.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是医生 你该出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You get a good case? - No, her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你遇到有趣的病例吗？ - 不是 是她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She won't let me sew her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不让我替她缝合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wouldn't have called you, but I can't get the translator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想叫你来 但找不到翻译
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you just ask her what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能问她怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不行 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I grew up in Beverly Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我在比佛利山长大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only Chinese I know is from a Mr. Chow's menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只认得周先生餐馆菜单上的中文
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Besides, I'm Korean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:29.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}况且 我是韩裔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you asked Shepherd to come to Grace, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你邀薛波来我们医院任职？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:45.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was an old student of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:45.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我以前的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He left a Manhattan private practice because you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他因为你一声邀请 就离开曼哈顿的私人诊所
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:50.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 没有其他原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No other reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:53.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a favor for an old professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:53.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是来帮忙老教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:55.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll be years before I retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:55.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还有几年才要退休呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chief of surgery is mine. Chief of surgery is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}外科主任的位子是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was yours. Now I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}曾经是 现在我不太确定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am the best surgeon at Grace with the lowest mortality rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是恩典医院最好的外科医生 手术死亡率是最低的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't just bring some...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能就这样邀…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:08.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now ask me why I'm not so sure about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:08.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问我为何不确定你能胜任
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:12.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ask me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:12.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问我原因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't people get sick anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人们都不生病了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, how are we supposed to get any OR time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果大家都活得好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if everyone's gonna just live?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要怎么得到手术机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:34.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take ten, you take ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:34.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我和你各负责十个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get in, get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快速解决
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No smiling, no hugging, no letting them cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不假笑、不拥抱、不等他们感动落泪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Just be quick about it. - You're the one that's slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 迅速搞定 - 慢吞吞的人是你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not slow. You are slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不慢 你才慢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:45.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You want to bet? - You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:45.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 要打赌吗？ - 好啊 赌了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- A comprehensive workup... - Did not reveal any...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 经过各项检验… - 没有发现任何…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:49.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}mild issue...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:49.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…异常状况
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your Doppler was negative...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超音波检验为阴性…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:54.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so there's no need for chronic anticoagulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:54.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…所以不需要长期服用抗凝血剂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Or an IBC pill... - Biopsy was positive...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 抗凝血或发炎性乳癌药… - 活检结果为阳性…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:17:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- for a mixed anaerobic... - streptococci infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:17:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- …混合性厌氧菌感染 - …链球菌感染
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your BUN creatinine elevations had us worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的尿素氮和肌酸酐升高 让我们很担心…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}about rapidly progressing glomerulonephritis
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急性恶化为肾小球性肾炎…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which could signal an autoimmune disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那可能暗示有自体免疫疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We're not amputating your leg. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不会切除你的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:10.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get to keep your kidneys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:10.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的肾脏保住了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations. You can go home today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:13.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜 你今天可以出院
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:15.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, yeah. Congratulations. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 恭喜 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations. There's nothing wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜 你的身体没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're going to be fine. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不会有事 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's your favorite '80s group?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最喜欢的80年代乐队？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Queen. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:31.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 皇后乐队 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:32.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twisted Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:32.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}扭曲姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not like there's a right or wrong answer to that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种问题又没有正确答案
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:39.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Go-Go's, Duran Duran, Eurythmics.
