Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You do only exactly as much as is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只做自己份内的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You never take an extra step.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:55.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从不多做、从不愿意多花时间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.21,0:22:55.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You never give an extra minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:59.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're comfortable and arrogant, and it doesn't impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:59.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以此自满且自负 那无法打动我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want to be Chief? Earn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想当主任？那就努力争取
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I have patients lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我有很多病人在等
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have time. I don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没时间 也听不懂你的话 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.79,0:23:40.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.79,0:23:40.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.25,0:23:55.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Bailey to Ortho, stat. Dr. Bailey to Ortho, stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.25,0:23:55.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利医生请马上到骨科
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:01.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的头好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:02.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's a tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:02.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许是长了肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wish I had a tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就希望我有肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:06.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'd rip your face off if it meant I got to scrub in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:06.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 若能参与手术 扯下你的脸皮我都愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:08.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been suturing all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:08.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一整天都在缝合
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.46,0:24:10.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My hands are numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.46,0:24:10.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的手麻掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least you're helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.92,0:24:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少你是在助人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.58,0:24:14.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least you get to practice freakin' medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.58,0:24:14.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少你是在从事医学治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to send my Chinese lady away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须叫那个中国女士离开
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:20.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was, like, camped out down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:20.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她一直待在外面不肯走
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:23.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Poor Izzie, turning away patients. Boo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:23.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可怜的伊兹 还得叫病人离开
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The police can't send a crime-scene guy down for hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}警方说几小时后采证人员才会来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so I have to spend the night with the penis.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我得和这根阴茎共度今宵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:35.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Alex, don't say it. - It was too easy, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:35.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 亚力克 别说 - 反正我现在也没力说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.75,0:24:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who here feels like they have no idea what they're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.75,0:24:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有谁觉得不知道自己在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.58,0:24:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we supposed to be learning something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.58,0:24:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不是应该学习吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.62,0:24:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I don't feel like I'm learning anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.62,0:24:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不觉得有学到任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.12,0:24:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Except how not to sleep. - It's like there's this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.12,0:24:49.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 只学到如何不睡觉 - 感觉有一道墙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.17,0:24:50.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The attendings and the residents
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.17,0:24:50.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主治医师和住院医师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:53.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}are over there being surgeons, and we're over here being...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:53.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在墙的另一边当外科医生 而我们在这边…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Suturing, code-running, lab-delivering penis minders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}缝合、急救、送检验报告、看守阴茎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.71,0:24:59.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate being an intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.71,0:24:59.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讨厌当实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.46,0:25:35.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.46,0:25:35.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:40.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Is he yours? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:40.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他是你们的宝宝？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He's adorable. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他好可爱 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.08,0:25:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are so out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.08,0:25:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.54,0:25:58.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She says the murmur might not be benign.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.54,0:25:58.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说心脏杂音可能不是良性的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.04,0:26:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we should do an echo to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.04,0:26:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为我们应该做心脏超音波检查
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.50,0:26:02.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.50,0:26:02.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的医生生涯完了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:06.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There really is no reason to get alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:06.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们没有必要惊慌
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.46,0:26:08.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.46,0:26:08.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.79,0:26:12.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If our baby is sick, we want him treated... now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.79,0:26:12.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我们的宝宝生病了 我们要他马上接受治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.83,0:26:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who said your baby was sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.83,0:26:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁说你们的宝宝病了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.04,0:26:16.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The surgical intern, who has no business on our service.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.04,0:26:16.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她 那个与我们部门无关的 外科实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.25,0:26:18.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who authorized you to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.25,0:26:18.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁授权你来这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I was just... - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我只是… - 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.75,0:26:22.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you excuse us for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.75,0:26:22.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.67,0:26:24.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.67,0:26:24.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.79,0:26:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you messing with my intern, Dr. Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.79,0:26:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯医生 你在欺负我的实习生吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.50,0:26:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, sir. - Give me the chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.50,0:26:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有 先生 - 病历给我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.71,0:26:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing wrong with him. I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.71,0:26:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有异常 我检查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:32.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are you sure? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:32.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你确定？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:35.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can guarantee he's fine? You're 100 percent sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:35.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能保证他没事？百分之百确定？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.08,0:26:41.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How sure are you? - I don't know, 75 percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.08,0:26:41.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你有多确定？ - 不知道 七成五吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.71,0:26:43.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not good enough. He's my patient now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.71,0:26:43.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样不够 他现在是我的病人了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.50,0:26:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That OK with you, Dr. Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.50,0:26:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以吗 凯医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:46.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.92,0:26:46.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.33,0:26:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He can take our patient? - He's an attending.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.33,0:26:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他能转走我们的病人？ - 他是主治医师
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.83,0:26:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which means I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.83,0:26:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那表示我想怎么做都行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.29,0:26:55.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. and Mrs. Johnson, I'm Dr. Burke, head of Cardio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.29,0:26:55.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}琼斯先生 琼斯太太 我是心脏科主治医师柏克
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.04,0:26:57.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're going to run some tests
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.04,0:26:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会做几项检验 并在一小时内给你们答案
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.67,0:26:59.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and give you an answer within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.92,0:27:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Grey. Excuse me. - Yes, Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.92,0:27:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 葛蕾 失陪 - 是 柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.54,0:27:06.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want an EKG, chest X-ray and an echo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.54,0:27:06.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}替他做心电图、胸部X光和超音波
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.29,0:27:08.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I don't have all day. - You're a busy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.29,0:27:08.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 赶紧办妥 - 你很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.50,0:27:10.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a busy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.50,0:27:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.62,0:27:14.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.62,0:27:14.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有伤员吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. No more. - Good. I need a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有了 - 很好 我需要躺一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ms. Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吕女士？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.75,0:27:36.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ms. Lu!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.75,0:27:36.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吕女士！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.00,0:27:38.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ms. Lu, wait! Ms. Lu!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.00,0:27:38.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吕女士 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.83,0:27:40.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.83,0:27:40.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.38,0:27:54.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.38,0:27:54.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吕女士？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:06.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:06.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:11.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's OK. It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:11.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.38,0:28:14.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll help, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.38,0:28:14.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会帮忙 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伤口很深
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.92,0:28:30.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's deep. I need to clean it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.92,0:28:30.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伤口很深 我必须清理伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:32.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Machine broke in the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:32.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}工厂的机器坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It fall. - You speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 掉下来 - 你会说英语
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.79,0:28:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just... If you could come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.79,0:28:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就…进去治疗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.12,0:28:40.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no inside. No... Jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.12,0:28:40.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 不能进去 会坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.17,0:28:43.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jail? She came inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.17,0:28:43.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐牢？她进去过
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.62,0:28:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She green card. Me, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.62,0:28:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有绿卡 我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.25,0:28:48.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.25,0:28:48.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是非法移民
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.04,0:28:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's OK. We don't have to tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.04,0:28:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 我们不必告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.88,0:28:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just need to get you inside. I have to sew that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.88,0:28:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只需要带你进去缝合伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.67,0:28:55.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No inside. - Please, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.67,0:28:55.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不行 不行进去 - 拜托 我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.79,0:28:57.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I promise you won't go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.79,0:28:57.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我保证你不会去坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.42,0:28:59.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just... It's raining. Please come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.42,0:28:59.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}外头在下雨 请进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.75,0:29:04.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, OK, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.75,0:29:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.83,0:29:05.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.83,0:29:05.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.62,0:29:12.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait here, OK? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.62,0:29:12.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这里等 好吗？等我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.67,0:29:14.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll come back. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.67,0:29:14.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会回来 马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:22.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well? - It's a birth defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:22.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 结果如何？ - 是天生缺陷
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.79,0:29:24.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tetralogy of Fallot with pulmonary atresia.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.79,0:29:24.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}法洛氏四合症和肺动脉瓣闭锁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.75,0:29:27.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were right. I'm booking he OR for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.75,0:29:27.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是对的 我替他预定明天动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.75,0:29:29.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you for backing me up on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.75,0:29:29.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你在这件事上挺我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.25,0:29:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.25,0:29:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 你确实对了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.54,0:29:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you ever pull a stunt like that again,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.54,0:29:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如果你再做出这种蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.62,0:29:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}going to the parents behind a doctor's back,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.62,0:29:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}背着医生跑去向父母碎嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}trying to steal a patient from another service,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想抢其他科室的病人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.50,0:29:41.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will make your residency here hell on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.50,0:29:41.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会让你在此实习的期间生不如死
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.62,0:30:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three, four, five. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.62,0:30:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三、四、五 呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:01.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charging to 200, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:01.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请充电到200伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Four, five. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}四、五 呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:52.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:52.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.58,0:31:03.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. You're all sewn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.58,0:31:03.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 缝合完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.29,0:31:08.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.29,0:31:08.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你配合得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.71,0:31:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could've done a better job if I'd had more light.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.71,0:31:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果亮一点 我能缝得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.29,0:31:14.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You might have a scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.29,0:31:14.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可能会留疤
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.83,0:31:23.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna need to come back in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.83,0:31:23.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你五天后得回来 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.83,0:31:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK? I'm gonna need to check the wound
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.83,0:31:27.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须检查伤口和拆线
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.62,0:31:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and remove the stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.79,0:31:28.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.79,0:31:28.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.88,0:31:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's my pager number on this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.88,0:31:35.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这名片上有我的传呼机号码 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right here, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.38,0:31:38.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll meet right back here, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.38,0:31:38.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们到时在这里见 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.21,0:31:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.21,0:31:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定要回来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you can't tell anybody that I helped you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你不能跟任何人说我帮过你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.12,0:31:44.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}outside of the hospital, or I might lose my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.12,0:31:44.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在医院外治疗会让我丢工作
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.96,0:31:46.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.96,0:31:46.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.17,0:31:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Come back and don't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.17,0:31:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂 回来跟不要说
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.88,0:31:49.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.88,0:31:49.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.50,0:31:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, that's it. I'm done. You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.50,0:31:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 就这样 你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.62,0:31:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll see you in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.62,0:31:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们五天后见
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.04,0:31:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.04,0:31:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:19.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:19.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.62,0:32:53.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think I'm too confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.62,0:32:54.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你觉得我过度自信吗？ - 不会
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.29,0:32:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.71,0:32:56.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.71,0:32:56.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:59.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:59.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我上司
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.42,0:33:06.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything you say in the next 30 seconds is free, starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.42,0:33:06.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接下来30秒你可以畅所欲言 开始
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.96,0:33:13.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you're cocky, arrogant, bossy and pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.96,0:33:13.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为你骄傲、自大、跋扈又蛮干
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.75,0:33:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You also have a God complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.75,0:33:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还有上帝情结
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.12,0:33:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You never think about anybody but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.12,0:33:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从不考虑其他人 只想到自己
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.00,0:33:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.29,0:33:20.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still have 22 more seconds. I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.29,0:33:20.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还有22秒 我还没说完
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.96,0:33:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need a drink, a man or a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.96,0:33:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要喝一杯、一个男人或按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.62,0:33:29.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or a drunken massage by a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.62,0:33:29.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或喝醉让男人按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.58,0:33:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.58,0:33:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:37.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I lost five patients on the code team today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:37.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天在急救小组没救活五个病人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.96,0:33:39.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel like the angel of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.96,0:33:39.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得自己像是死亡天使
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.42,0:33:43.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, 95 percent of all code patients can't be revived.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.42,0:33:43.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 九成五的急救病患都救不活
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.71,0:33:46.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Most of them are seriously dead before you even get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.71,0:33:46.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们大多在你赶到前就已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.21,0:33:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.21,0:33:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.38,0:33:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why didn't you tell me that when I was going on and on
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.38,0:33:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何在我不断说这工作有多棒时
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:54.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}about how great it was gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:54.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不告诉我这数据？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.38,0:33:59.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you're George and I'm Cristina.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.38,0:33:59.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是乔治 而我是克里斯廷娜
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.75,0:34:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His heart surgery is scheduled for the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.75,0:34:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的心脏手术排在早上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.54,0:34:17.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really did think I was right, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.54,0:34:17.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的认为自己是对的 你懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.25,0:34:19.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.25,0:34:19.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:24.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We almost never are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:24.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们几乎从没对过
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.50,0:34:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're interns. We're not supposed to be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.50,0:34:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是实习医生 本就不该是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:30.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And when we are, it's completely shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:30.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们判断正确是很令人震惊的事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.29,0:34:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.29,0:34:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.46,0:34:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, being an intern, do you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.46,0:34:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身为实习医生 你会不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.96,0:34:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.96,0:34:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.42,0:34:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One hundred percent of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.42,0:34:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我时刻都感到害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.25,0:34:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. It's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.25,0:34:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就好 不是只有我会怕
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.21,0:34:46.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.21,0:34:46.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.79,0:35:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.79,0:35:05.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.83,0:35:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.83,0:35:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没变化
