Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.25,0:39:59.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 乔治和伊兹 你们可以搬来住
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.62,0:40:03.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yes! - I can't believe you caved!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.62,0:40:03.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 太好了！ - 你竟然让步了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.04,0:40:05.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.04,0:40:05.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.75,0:40:06.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.75,0:40:06.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.08,0:40:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I caved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.08,0:40:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我竟然让步了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.58,0:40:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I blame the babies. They make you toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.58,0:40:13.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都怪婴儿 害你神智不清
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.83,0:40:18.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you can waste your life drawing lines...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.83,0:40:18.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以浪费生命 划下界线…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.46,0:40:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or you can live your life crossing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.46,0:40:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或跨越界线 好好过你的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.92,0:40:37.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.92,0:40:37.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.62,0:40:57.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But there are some lines...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.62,0:40:57.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有些界线…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.38,0:41:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, it's intense.
