Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.25,0:41:02.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好强烈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This thing I have for ferryboats, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我对渡轮的喜爱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.04,0:41:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That are way too dangerous to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.04,0:41:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…跨越就实在太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.33,0:41:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm so taking the stairs this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.33,0:41:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这次还是走楼梯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.92,0:41:15.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No self-control.
