Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.75,0:41:40.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一边的景色…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.62,0:41:44.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is spectacular.
